# Plans: no absolute file paths

When writing or updating plan documents under `.cursor/plans/`:

- **Never use absolute file paths**, such as `/Users/...`, `/home/...`, or `C:\...`.
- **Use repo-relative paths** instead (for example: `src/pages/gpa/GpaPage.tsx`).
- When linking files in markdown, use relative links: `[text](src/.../file.tsx)`.
